# EOSL ETL Pipeline Documentation

## Overview

This project implements a robust ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) pipeline for aggregating, transforming, and loading infrastructure and asset data from multiple enterprise sources into a SQL Server database. The system is designed to automate the collection and normalization of data from VMware vROps, AMPs, DPA, NAS, SAN, AIOPS, IBM, and other sources, supporting end-of-service-life (EOSL) analysis and reporting.

The pipeline is modular, with clear separation between extraction, transformation, and loading logic, and is highly configurable via a centralized configuration file and environment variables.

---

